      "n": 1,
      "signpost": "grammar",
      "definition": "a word such as **and**, **but**, **because**, or **although** that joins words, phrases, or parts of a sentence",
      "explanation": "Some conjunctions join two equal parts (*bread and butter*, *small but strong*). Others begin a part of a sentence that depends on the main part, such as **because**, **when**, **if**, and **although** (*I stayed home because I was sick*).",
